# Redesign test environment (blockout variations, not for deploy)
# The lab is IN version control now (D49, Rod 2026-08-25: "we actually do want to keep it").
# It never ships: the deploy workflow deletes it from _site after the build, before the
# test and upload steps. Cleaned 140 MB -> 77 MB before this line changed, so history
# starts from the small version - git keeps every committed blob forever.
# The two hold piles below stay OUT until Rod closes the merge (his call, 2026-08-25,
# "leave this for once we are actually finished merging completely"). The trash pile also
# contains a nested git clone that would commit as a broken submodule pointer, and the
# backup pile mirrors the live tree's own paths, which is a wrong-file hazard.
redesign-lab/_TRASH-2026-08-25/
redesign-lab/_BACKUP-pre-deletion-2026-08-26/

# Reel editing source material (large MP4s, planning docs)
.claude/reel-planning/
